--- !u!114 &704661520
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 704661518}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 573620f547112064a85bdb06cb0f0c63, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  canvas: {fileID: 756288822}
  text: {fileID: 536513602}
  textBox: {fileID: 992246651}
  textTypingSpeed: 0.05
  nameText: {fileID: 382923170}
  CharacterLeft: {fileID: 2088251235}
  CharacterRight: {fileID: 620149139}
  readingTime: 7
  intro1Start: 0
  intro1Completed: 0
  dialogueTextChoices:
  - 
  dialogueQueue: []
  dialogueCount: 0
  isTalking: 0
  characters: []
  dialogueSequences:
  - lines:
    - speaker:
        name: Player
        sprite: {fileID: 0}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: Ughhh.......
    - speaker:
        name: Player
        sprite: {fileID: 0}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: My Head... It hurts...
    - speaker:
        name: Timmy
        sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 02613a1d2daf1bc468f710f9e059d7ea, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 0
        inRightPosition: 1
      line: Mistress! He's awake!
    - speaker:
        name: CatKeeper
        sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c071b25facdc5547bdf280f1222138d, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: Good, You're finally awake. We found you unconsious in the Sanctum Forest.
    - speaker:
        name: Boss
        sprite: {fileID: 3428898759890286093, guid: 270fd18c418c039418fbff140d9eb922, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 0
        inRightPosition: 1
      line: Been sleeping and freeloading on our hospitality huh?
    - speaker:
        name: CatKeeper
        sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c071b25facdc5547bdf280f1222138d, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: Zeke, Sweetie! Don't be so rude! It's been ages since we saw another
        human.
    - speaker:
        name: Boss
        sprite: {fileID: 3428898759890286093, guid: 270fd18c418c039418fbff140d9eb922, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 0
        inRightPosition: 1
      line: Hmph.. Humans all backstabbing rats. You are and exception, my lady.
    - speaker:
        name: Outside
        sprite: {fileID: 0}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: EXPLOSION! EXPLOSION!
    - speaker:
        name: Timmy
        sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 02613a1d2daf1bc468f710f9e059d7ea, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 0
        inRightPosition: 1
      line: 'Trouble! Trouble! Inklings have found us! They are swarming our car!

'
    - speaker:
        name: Boss
        sprite: {fileID: 3428898759890286093, guid: 270fd18c418c039418fbff140d9eb922, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: Get ready everyone! We're evacuating immediately!
    - speaker:
        name: Timmy
        sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 02613a1d2daf1bc468f710f9e059d7ea, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 0
        inRightPosition: 1
      line: The thing is... They blew off one of our tires! We have to repair it
        before we can move!
    - speaker:
        name: Boss
        sprite: {fileID: 3428898759890286093, guid: 270fd18c418c039418fbff140d9eb922, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: Drats! Why didn't you you start with that. All cats to battle position!
        Buy me time to repair our home!
  - lines:
    - speaker:
        name: Boss
        sprite: {fileID: 3428898759890286093, guid: 270fd18c418c039418fbff140d9eb922, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: I am done with the repairs! Everyone double up and get back in here!
        DOUBLE TIME NOW!
    - speaker:
        name: Timmy
        sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 02613a1d2daf1bc468f710f9e059d7ea, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 0
        inRightPosition: 1
      line: 'Oh! Time to ski-daddle out of here! Run!

'
  - lines:
    - speaker:
        name: CatKeeper
        sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c071b25facdc5547bdf280f1222138d, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: 'Good job Boss and Timmy! Thank you for getting us out of there. '
    - speaker:
        name: Timmy
        sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 02613a1d2daf1bc468f710f9e059d7ea, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 0
        inRightPosition: 1
      line: Always a jolly pleasure! You can rely on mee!
    - speaker:
        name: Boss
        sprite: {fileID: 3428898759890286093, guid: 270fd18c418c039418fbff140d9eb922, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 0
        inRightPosition: 1
      line: Always ready to protect my mistress. You weren't too bad yourself. Maybe
        you do have a use afterall.
    - speaker:
        name: CatKeeper
        sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c071b25facdc5547bdf280f1222138d, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: Yes! You were really good at giving out commands to Timmy. As if you
        are used to it.
    - speaker:
        name: Boss
        sprite: {fileID: 3428898759890286093, guid: 270fd18c418c039418fbff140d9eb922, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 0
        inRightPosition: 1
      line: But don't get too high on yourself. Now we have an extra mouth to feed.
        I suggest we head to the ruined city to get some supplies.
    - speaker:
        name: Timmy
        sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 02613a1d2daf1bc468f710f9e059d7ea, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: Whatever you say boss! Gotta keep our mistress well-fed!
  - lines:
    - speaker:
        name: CatKeeper
        sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c071b25facdc5547bdf280f1222138d, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: 'No!!... The cats... '
    - speaker:
        name: Boss
        sprite: {fileID: 3428898759890286093, guid: 270fd18c418c039418fbff140d9eb922, type: 3}
        inLeftPosition: 0
        inRightPosition: 1
      line: Darn it.... Let's quickly fall back........
  - lines:
    - speaker:
        name: TEST
        sprite: {fileID: 0}
        inLeftPosition: 1
        inRightPosition: 0
      line: 'TEST

'
  deathDialoguePlay: 0
  deathDialogueEnd: 0
